WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.870
What if one agent's experience could help many others?

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:08.004
Introducing EpiCon: collective agent learning through co-evolving multimodal memory.

00:00:08.254 --> 00:00:14.300
EpiCon turns past executions into shared experience, without updating the host model's parameters.

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:19.346
Two independently trained, two-billion-parameter models manage memory.

00:00:19.596 --> 00:00:22.670
A memory controller refines guidance within a question.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:29.298
A tree self-organizer consolidates lessons across questions, keeping experience available to different agent

00:00:29.298 --> 00:00:29.789
systems.

00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:33.754
Consider the paper's illustrative transit-map example.

00:00:34.004 --> 00:00:37.786
An incorrect route triggers revised guidance and a more useful image crop.

00:00:38.036 --> 00:00:41.667
Across attempts, text and visual evidence evolve together.

00:00:41.917 --> 00:00:45.446
The controller also decides when visual memory should be included.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:51.602
Related lessons from multiple cities are organized and consolidated into a reusable routing rule.

00:00:51.852 --> 00:00:55.599
A new question can retrieve that guidance and solve in a single attempt.

00:00:55.849 --> 00:00:59.818
These trajectories and tree operations are reconstructed for illustration.

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:06.593
Across eleven benchmarks and four task domains, the compact EpiCon variant improves macro-average scores by one

00:01:06.593 --> 00:01:10.275
point seven to four point nine points over no memory.

00:01:10.525 --> 00:01:16.680
All methods in the main comparison make one solving attempt, with historical banks frozen during evaluation.

00:01:17.533 --> 00:01:24.399
The two compact memory models reduce memory-operation time by sixty-seven to seventy-four percent relative to

00:01:24.399 --> 00:01:26.230
backbone-sized EpiCon memory models.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:31.876
This reduction concerns memory operations, not the total time required to solve a task.

00:01:32.733 --> 00:01:38.622
A frozen bank transfers across backbones and harnesses, with macro-average gains of three point two and four

00:01:38.622 --> 00:01:39.661
point two points.

00:01:39.911 --> 00:01:45.858
When another harness expands and evolves the bank, the original contributor gains two point one to three point

00:01:45.858 --> 00:01:46.519
two points.

00:01:46.769 --> 00:01:49.228
Individual benchmarks do not all improve.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:56.737
EpiCon connects multimodal memory refinement, hierarchical consolidation, and shared experience reuse.

00:01:56.987 --> 00:01:58.269
Learn from execution.

00:01:58.519 --> 00:01:59.736
Preserve the evidence.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:01.813
Build on one another's experience.
